(DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS - STATEMENT OF WORK) Tj T*
(Solicitation 36C10B26Q0417: VBA Benefits Dashboard Modernization) Tj T*
(1. Background. The Veterans Benefits Administration \(VBA\) runs a legacy) Tj T*
(benefits-status dashboard built on ASP.NET Web Forms and SQL Server.) Tj T*
(2. Scope. The contractor shall re-platform the dashboard as a React front end) Tj T*
(and Python \(FastAPI\) services on AWS GovCloud, migrate the reporting database to) Tj T*
(PostgreSQL, and deliver automated tests and a CI/CD pipeline.) Tj T*
(3. Period of performance: a 12-month base period and two 12-month option periods.) Tj T*
(4. Place of performance: contractor site \(remote\). No security clearance is) Tj T*
(required; personnel must pass a VA Tier 1 background investigation.) Tj T*
(5. Key personnel: a technical lead and a senior full-stack developer.) Tj T*
(SECTION M - EVALUATION FACTORS FOR AWARD) Tj T*
(Award will be made on a best-value tradeoff basis. Factors, in descending order) Tj T*
(of importance: Factor 1 Technical Approach; Factor 2 Past Performance;) Tj T*
(Factor 3 Price. Factors 1 and 2 combined are significantly more important) Tj T*
(than price.) Tj T*
